Third-party software in the customer-hosted capture data plane:

- PostgreSQL (postgres:17-alpine), PostgreSQL License
- MinIO (minio/minio), GNU AGPLv3 — object storage is an optional bundled dependency; customers may substitute any S3-compatible store
- Chromium and fonts-liberation in the Google Meet worker image, BSD/MIT/LGPL as shipped by Debian
- Vexa Apache-2.0 reference material: see `enterprise/google-meet-worker/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`

Pinned image digests live in Compose files. Helm `values.yaml` uses the same tagged images; production installs should pin digests in an overlay.
